      <div class="dp6-specs__row"><span class="dp6-specs__label">Akku</span><span class="dp6-specs__val">Li-Ion, optional (&gt;90 Min)</span></div>
      <div class="dp6-specs__row"><span class="dp6-specs__label">Speicher</span><span class="dp6-specs__val">Integrierte Festplatte</span></div>
      <div class="dp6-specs__row"><span class="dp6-specs__label">Bildmodi Standard</span><span class="dp6-specs__val">B-Mode, M-Mode, Power Doppler</span></div>
      <div class="dp6-specs__row"><span class="dp6-specs__label">Bildmodi Optional</span><span class="dp6-specs__val">PW Doppler + HPRF, Color Doppler — nein</span></div>
      <div class="dp6-specs__row"><span class="dp6-specs__label">Bildverb. Standard</span><span class="dp6-specs__val">iBeam™, iClear™, iTouch™, THI, TSI, B-Steer, Trapezoid</span></div>
      <div class="dp6-specs__row"><span class="dp6-specs__label">Bildverb. Optional</span><span class="dp6-specs__val">iScape™ Panorama, ExFOV, Auto IMT, iNeedle™, iWorks</span></div>
      <div class="dp6-specs__row"><span class="dp6-specs__label">Connectivity</span><span class="dp6-specs__val">DICOM 3.0, USB, LAN</span></div>
      <div class="dp6-specs__row"><span class="dp6-specs__label">Betriebssystem</span><span class="dp6-specs__val">Embedded Linux</span></div>
      <div class="dp6-specs__row" style="grid-column:1/-1"><span class="dp6-specs__label">Kardiologie</span><span class="dp6-specs__val dp6-specs__val--warn">⚠ Kein Adult/Pädiatrisch Kardio — für Echokardiographie bitte Z60 oder Z50 wählen</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dp6-specs__probes" id="dp6-specs-probes">
      <h3 class="dp6-specs__probes-h3">Kompatible Schallköpfe (Auswahl)</h3>
      <p class="dp6-specs__probes-sub">Der DP-60 unterstützt das bewährte Mindray-Schallkopfportfolio für Allgemein-, Gefäß- und OB/GYN-Diagnostik.</p>
